name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q12_2026'

question 'A fitness tracker awards a "Daily Goal" badge if the user takes 10,000 steps AND stretches for at least 5 minutes. Which logical operator does the code need?'

wrong 'OR — either condition is enough on its own.'
right 'AND — both conditions must be true at the same time.'
wrong 'NOT — only one condition must be false.'
wrong 'No operator — either step count or stretching alone awards the badge.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

